  "atlas_nucleus_intro": "Orbit the complete gold-197 composition, approach a proton or neutron, then move a section through the interior. Each view keeps the same 14 fm reference.",
  "atlas_nucleus_scope": "The count is exact for gold-197; the arrangement is a teaching model. Real nuclei are quantum systems. Colored markers, their sizes and packing do not represent measured nucleon positions or solid beads. The section reveals the model without changing its isotope.",
  "atlas_nucleus_rms": "Measured RMS charge radius",
